{#- Working now, its empty line or its cards, from one partial with the one id `working-now`, so the board's push replaces it with the same markup a page loaded after it shows. Not `working`: the Status page holds `#working` and listens to the same shell topic, so a board push must not replace its lanes (#3386). No disclosure: each change in progress is its own card, and a card opens its review (UX2: no collapsibles on overview pages). -#}
{% set cards = board.workingNow %}
{% if cards is empty %}
<p class="working working-none" id="working-now">{{ board.nobodyWorkingNowLine }}</p>
{% else %}
<section class="working" id="working-now" aria-labelledby="working-now-h">
    <h2 id="working-now-h">Working now <span class="w-count">{{ cards|length }}</span></h2>
    <div class="w-cards">
    {% for card in cards %}
        {{ include('dashboard/_working_card.html.twig', {card: card}, with_context = false) }}
    {% endfor %}
    </div>
</section>
{% endif %}
